  "description": "<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt;\">At <strong>Beautiful Beast Coffee Company</strong>, we believe that every cup of coffee should be as bold and untamed as the wild itself. Our premium, ethically sourced coffee beans are certified <strong>Smithsonian Bird-Friendly</strong>, ensuring that every sip supports thriving ecosystems and protects the incredible creatures that call them home.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt;\">More than just great coffee, we are on a mission to preserve the world’s most extraordinary animals—from soaring birds to elusive mammals, resilient reptiles, and vital pollinators. With every bag sold, we champion biodiversity, sustainability, and the beauty of nature’s most remarkable beasts.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt;\">Join us in drinking coffee with a purpose.</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;\">We offer a variety of different coffees that are small-batched roasted. All of our beans are shade-grown from farms that support wildlife conservation.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt;\">The <strong>unique selling point (USP)</strong> of <strong>Beautiful Beast Coffee Company</strong> is its <strong>mission-driven, eco-conscious approach to premium coffee</strong>—blending <strong>exceptional taste</strong> with <strong>wildlife conservation</strong>.</span></p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:12pt;\"><strong>Key Differentiators:</strong></span></h3>\n<ol>\n<li style=\"font-size:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;\"><strong>Smithsonian Bird-Friendly Certified Coffee</strong> – The highest standard for organic, shade-grown coffee that preserves forests and protects biodiversity.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-size:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;\"><strong>Wildlife Conservation Mission</strong> – Every purchase directly supports habitats for birds, mammals, reptiles, amphibians, and pollinators.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-size:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;\"><strong>Exceptional Quality</strong> – Specialty-grade coffee beans, sustainably sourced and expertly roasted for a rich, bold flavor.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-size:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;\"><strong>Ethical &amp; Sustainable</strong> – A commitment to eco-friendly farming practices that benefit both farmers and the environment.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-size:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;\"><strong>A Brand with a Purpose</strong> – Consumers aren’t just buying coffee; they’re joining a movement to <strong>save our beautiful beasts.</strong></span></li>\n</ol>\n<p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;\"> • Payment terms:</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;\">You will earn 10% commission on sales from new customers. But the best part is that you will continue to earn 1% on lifetime sales, which is incredible for coffee where people buy over and over. Cookie window is 30 days.</span></p>",
